**Program Summary:**

This program models the full workflow:
- **Preheat track**: Oven heats 15 min before chocolate chip baking can start
- **Sugar cookies**: Mix (12m) → Chill (1h) → Roll/cut (14m) → Bake (9m) → Cool cookies (10m) + Cool pan (20m)
- **Chocolate chip**: Mix (12m) → Scoop (6m) → Bake (11m) → Cool cookies (12m) + Cool pan (20m)
- **Gingerbread**: Mix (15m) → Chill (2h) → Roll/cut (18m) → Bake (10m) → Cool (15m) → Ice (25m)
- **Finishing**: Box all three types (10m), after all cookies are cool
- **Pan constraint**: 2 sheet pans that must cool 20 minutes between uses; the gingerbread bake is gated by the first pan cooling

The critical path runs through the gingerbread's 2-hour chill and the pan-cooling bottleneck. Total program time: approximately **5 hours 33 minutes**.
